 Games played in ; G 

 = Goals ; A = 

 Assists ; Pts 

 = Points ; PIM = 

 Penalty minutes ; + / - = Plus / minus 

 = = = Goaltenders = = = 

 Note : GP 

 = Games Played ; TOI = 

