For example, if the cafe is placed at junction u, that's equivalent to placing it on any edge that has u as an endpoint. For example, if u is connected to v with a road of length w, then placing the cafe at u is x=0 on edge (u, v, w), which is processed in the code.

Thus, the code will automatically consider all possible junction placements as part of the edges' x=0 or x=w cases.

