```python
a, b = map(int, input().split())
count = 0
for m in range(1, 61):
    for n in range(0, 61):
        left = (1 << m) - 1
        shift = n + 1
        right = (1 << n) - 1
        num = (left << shift) | right
        if a <= num <= b:
            count += 1
print(count)
```
