    if new_length > len(last_occ):

        last_occ.append(current_last)

    else:

        if current_last < last_occ[new_length - 1]:

            last_occ[new_length - 1] = current_last

This way, the last_occ list is always maintained with the minimal possible last_occurrence for each possible sequence length.

