1. Precompute Stirling numbers of the second kind S(k, t) for all t from 0 to k. The recurrence is S(n, k) = k*S(n-1, k) + S(n-1, k-1), with base cases S(0,0)=1, S(n,0)=0 for n>0, S(0, k)=0 for k>0.

